      "claim": "There is no open question that would force escalation under POL-GEN-26. Every fact the applicable row of POL-RD-24 needs is carried by COMPLETE artifacts at weight_multiplier 1.0: the deviation distance by the platform trip record, and the absence of traffic justification by the LTA advisory. The deviation of 1.30 km is under 2 km, and the only impaired artifact on the file - the chat log - bears on notification, which POL-RD-24 row (d) does not make a condition because it applies whether or not the rider was informed. The rider's money should be returned, not held.",
